msgid ""
"这一页对应软件底部状态栏和常见提示。操作前后先核对 `原始 / 当前 / 删 / 选 / 坏`， "
"可以避免把“已选择”“已标记”和“已删除”混为一谈。"
msgstr "This page covers the bottom status bar and common messages. Check `Orig / Now / Rm / Sel / Rej` before and after an operation so that selected, marked, and deleted structures are not confused."

#: ../../source/module/nep-display-status-and-errors.md:5
