msgstr "7. Status and common messages"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:19933
#: 68cb1679ff1d48adab8f13e87201128f
msgid ""
"数据状态：`原始 / 当前 / 删 / 选 / "
"坏`，分别是原始结构数、当前显示数、已删除数、已选中数和标记为坏点的数量；鼠标悬停时还会显示未选中数量。"
msgstr "Dataset status: `Orig / Now / Rm / Sel / Rej` are the original, currently shown, removed, selected, and marked-bad counts; hovering also shows the unselected count."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:19934
#: 14c1473f22ee4e73b74627675e692118
msgid "结构状态：最短键长异常会红字提示；净力显示 `|ΣF|`。"
msgstr ""
"Structure status: an anomalous shortest bond length is shown in red; net "
"force is displayed as `|ΣF|`."

